{"id":"fae50ce87c0c5e77","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl.md","title":"Substitution Preserves GL Theorems","display":"thm-substitution-lemma-gl — Substitution Preserves GL Theorems","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl","aliases":["89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl"],"display":"thm-substitution-lemma-gl — Substitution Preserves GL Theorems","depends_on":["[[89-df-substitution-modal]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-substitution-lemma-gl — Substitution Preserves GL Theorems"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" href=\"?note=48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" title=\"89-df-substitution-modal\">89-df-substitution-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[p:=B]\">\\(A[p:=B]\\)</span> 是结构替换。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是公理模式、MP 与必然化生成的定理集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}lemma\\text{-}gl}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow A[p:=B]\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}lemma\\text{-}gl}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow A[p:=B]\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 5–6；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>对一条有限 GL 证明的长度归纳。公理已取全部命题、K、Löb 模式实例，替换后仍是同一种模式实例；MP 的公式匹配经替换保持。必然化步使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Box C)[p:=B]=\\Box(C[p:=B])\">\\((\\Box C)[p:=B]=\\Box(C[p:=B])\\)</span>，对已替换的前行再必然化。由此每一行均得到合法新证明。\n该论证先于 GL 正规性：不依赖“GL 已正规”的结论，避免用替换闭包证明自身。原语言没有量词绑定字母，“无捕获”在这里由结构语法自动满足。本次修正原 Remark 中缺括号的等式和错误的第 1–3 页来源。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-substitution-modal","status":"resolved","id":"48f7a8aeae4eecb4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-substitution-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A[p:=B]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}lemma\\text{-}gl}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow A[p:=B]\\in\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\Box C)[p:=B]=\\Box(C[p:=B])","display":false}],"bytes":1407,"backlinks":[{"id":"426d9ae12ef39fe8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"03089c3cefed4872","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ccac24cdfa254e90","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84538a9442ddea2d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ae10ea6d3d0420ac","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ce272d08b1c31931","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]] → [[89-df-normal-modal-logic]] → [[89-df-gl-logic]] → [[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl]] → [[89-lem-gl-normal]] → [[89-thm-gl-consistency]]"}],"outgoing":["48f7a8aeae4eecb4","0006800fa1c85177"]}